*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : MLC1550-102
* Inductance = 1uH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 100kHz-90MHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor Frequency Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt MLC1550-102_freq port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=6.96pF Ind=1uH
X1 port1 port2 Model1A PARAMS:
+ R1=36
+ R2=0.00172
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.000001
+ K2=0.067
+ K3= {Ind}
+ K4=0.009
+ K5=0.000009
.ends MLC1550-102_freq

